<title>USA: Imatron wins order for 5 Ultrafast scanners.</title>
<headline>Imatron wins order for 5 Ultrafast scanners.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO, Calif. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imatron Inc said on Friday the company has received an order for five Ultrafast CT scanners from a medical investment group in Malaysia, which will generate $13 million in revenues over the next two and one-half years.</p>
<p>The firm will ship the first scanner of the order in the first quarter of 1997, with the second scanner scheduled to be shipped before the end of the year.</p>
